      "description": "<p>The animated dragonstorm directs a 30ft Cone of dragonstorm energy. This deals 3d8 Acid Damage,3d8[electricity],3d8[fire],3d8[poison]|options:area-damage]{3d8 acid, 3d8 cold, 3d8 electricity, 3d8 fire, and 3d8 poison damage} to creatures in the cone (Basic DC 40 Reflex Saving Throw save). The animated dragonstorm can't use Channel Dragonstorm again for 1d4 rounds.</p>",
